{"data": [{"author_id": "2112084592153026560", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:54:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119956846962454994"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 33, "start": 29, "tag": "SPX"}, {"end": 39, "start": 35, "tag": "BTC"}, {"end": 44, "start": 40, "tag": "ETH"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/1YUf33WhHa", "end": 68, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2119956846962454994/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119956602916900864", "start": 45, "url": "https://t.co/1YUf33WhHa"}]}, "id": "2119956846962454994", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "SPX  缠论详细分析和走势画图，需要的可以一起交流讨论 #SPX  #BTC #ETH https://t.co/1YUf33WhHa", "url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2119956846962454994"}, {"author_id": "1706245213411557376", "created_at": "2026-11-10T01:14:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119961739244573022"], "id": "2119961739244573022", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 29653, "like_count": 67, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "同样一片汉中，魏延只用两万来人，依托外围关隘，稳稳守住四十四年。\n\n到了姜维手里，曹魏十八万大军一到，短短三个月，汉中防线直接崩塌。\n\n很多人说，是姜维改了祖宗留下来的防御法子，亲手拆掉了蜀汉的大门。这件事，到底该怎么看？", "url": "https://x.com/JDveif/status/2119961739244573022"}, {"author_id": "1687661863193264128", "created_at": "2026-11-10T04:55:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120017469251498236"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/2h0mJ1XDC5", "end": 182, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lxp720803/status/2120017469251498236/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120017452126044160", "start": 159, "url": "https://t.co/2h0mJ1XDC5"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/2h0mJ1XDC5", "end": 182, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lxp720803/status/2120017469251498236/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120017452117712896", "start": 159, "url": "https://t.co/2h0mJ1XDC5"}]}, "id": "2120017469251498236", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 172, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📊 一、盘面硬核解析（15分钟 + 3小时）\n \n1. 小级别结构（15分钟）：冲高受阻，再次测试低点\n看图1，早间价格最高反抽至 75,443.5，未能突破昨日高点，随后再次回落，最低砸到 74,373.4，现在回到 74,667。从缠论结构看，15分钟级别的向上笔在 75,443 遇阻，向下笔正在延伸。MACD https://t.co/2h0mJ1XDC5", "url": "https://x.com/lxp720803/status/2120017469251498236"}, {"author_id": "1116454614", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:35:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119936825007718895"], "id": "2119936825007718895", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 157, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "每天收盘后，AI 替你把自选股全看一遍，这事已经有 6.9 万人点了星。\n\n「daily_stock_analysis」是 LLM 驱动的多市场股票分析系统，覆盖 A 股、港股、美股、日股、韩股、台股和 ETF，每天自动出一份决策仪表盘，推到企业微信、飞书、Telegram 这些地方。\n\n1️⃣ Fork 一下、填个模型 API Key，5", "url": "https://x.com/ieddysun/status/2119936825007718895"}, {"author_id": "2086449421777281024", "created_at": "2026-11-10T05:33:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120026967877779890"], "id": "2120026967877779890", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "兄弟们，炒股这事 AI 已经卷到每天替你盯盘了。\n\n刷到个开源项目 daily_stock_analysis，Python 写的，6.9万 星，MIT 协议。\n\n你填好自选股，它每天拉行情、新闻、公告，出一份决策仪表盘推给你。\n\nA股、港股、美股、日股、韩股、台股和 ETF 都覆盖。\n报告里有评分、趋势、买卖点位、风险警报。", "url": "https://x.com/BlackKingNew/status/2120026967877779890"}, {"author_id": "78854956", "created_at": "2026-11-10T03:27:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119995205873242242", "2119995416045617167"], "id": "2119995416045617167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 459, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "暴论：同居过的女人，基本都会被操得又软又熟。\n老陈酒后这么说时，小李没吭声。\n他跟小美同居两年。夜里她总是先湿，穴口又滑又软，一顶就全进去。有一晚她加班回来很迟，小李装睡，从门缝看见她站在镜前，两根手指插进自己穴里快速抽插，水声清晰，低声喘着说：“还是他……操得深。”", "url": "https://x.com/Zhenaishe/status/2119995416045617167"}, {"author_id": "1773757013631393792", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:34:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119951672969506991"], "id": "2119951672969506991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 214, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我指点你几句吧，最后能不能学有所成，就是你自己的本事了。", "url": "https://x.com/wanglongbird/status/2119951672969506991"}, {"author_id": "481549882", "created_at": "2026-11-10T05:58:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120033355119145247"], "id": "2120033355119145247", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2874, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "讲个暴论：观察女的被插进去之后的反应，基本就能看出来她到底有多浪。\n\n青铜那种，刚进去就咬着牙硬憋，声音又轻又干，一点都不润，腰僵得跟块木头一样，手只会死死抓着你胳膊。水少还不滑，操一会儿就开始躲，全程感觉在配合你完事，敷衍得很。", "url": "https://x.com/0x6688PH/status/2120033355119145247"}, {"author_id": "1756633249785503744", "created_at": "2026-11-10T01:30:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119965981154177085"], "id": "2119965981154177085", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 163, "impression_count": 186894, "like_count": 386, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 69, "retweet_count": 21}, "text": "讲个暴论：观察女的被插入之后的反应，基本就能判断她到底有多浪。  \n青铜：刚插进去就咬着牙憋着，声音又轻又干，一点也不润，腰僵得跟块木头似的，手只会死死抓着你的胳膊。水少不滑，操一会儿就开始躲，感觉全程在配合你完事，很敷衍。", "url": "https://x.com/dabaizhenbang/status/2119965981154177085"}, {"author_id": "2086344132163989504", "created_at": "2026-11-10T02:53:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119986782582329615"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/1isNsI5qGh", "end": 176, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Curingieul/status/2119986782582329615/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119986673773686784", "start": 153, "url": "https://t.co/1isNsI5qGh"}]}, "id": "2119986782582329615", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "自选股一多，收盘后挨个点开看 K 线、翻公告、刷新闻，一圈下来半个多小时，第二天还得再来一遍。\n\nGitHub 上有个 daily_stock_analysis 就是干这个的。把自选股代码填进去，它每天自动拉行情、技术指标、新闻和公告，交给大模型写一份「决策仪表盘」，推到企业微信、飞书、Telegram https://t.co/1isNsI5qGh", "url": "https://x.com/Curingieul/status/2119986782582329615"}, {"author_id": "1126111986729623552", "created_at": "2026-11-10T03:59:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120003371616882765"], "id": "2120003371616882765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 121, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一发生婚外情、出轨，大家马上同仇敌忾，说有身份、有地位的男人管不住自己，对不住原配和孩子。马的，男人也是人，不是机器。", "url": "https://x.com/jaker_Q/status/2120003371616882765"}, {"author_id": "146000731", "created_at": "2026-11-10T05:47:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120030636488724521"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/nHuXo72RSF", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RituWithAI/status/2120030636488724521/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120030627739369474", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/nHuXo72RSF"}]}, "id": "2120030636488724521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 246, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Automated stock picking just went full open-source agentic—and retail investors are ditching paid terminal subscriptions in droves. ⚠️\n\ndaily_stock_analysis (DSA) by ZhuLinsen just crossed 69k+ stars on GitHub, establishing itself as the premier open-source multi-market AI stock https://t.co/nHuXo72RSF", "url": "https://x.com/RituWithAI/status/2120030636488724521"}, {"author_id": "22236944", "created_at": "2026-11-09T23:29:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119935531635060924"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/MWfP9eIM1p", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/dylanzhao/status/2119935531635060924/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119935520348233728", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/MWfP9eIM1p"}]}, "id": "2119935531635060924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 425, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "【特朗普称卸任前拟签署大规模赦免令：“椭圆形办公室方圆1000英里内的人都算”】\n\n一、 采访背景与核心表态\n在 2026 年 11 月 3 日美国中期选举共和党选情不利后，美国总统特朗普于 2026 年 11 月 8 日 播出的 CBS《60 分钟》专访中接受了主持人罗斯·杜塔特（Ross https://t.co/MWfP9eIM1p", "url": "https://x.com/dylanzhao/status/2119935531635060924"}, {"author_id": "1866285471019532288", "created_at": "2026-11-10T02:46:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119984972375474610"], "id": "2119984972375474610", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 199, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天 GitHub 日榜：AI 把录音棚和剪辑台都搬进你电脑了，云端订阅压力来了！\n剔除往期重复后，5 个涨星最猛的新项目！\n1. debpalash/VoiceStudio\n开源、全本地的 ElevenLabs 平替，AI 语音工作室直接装进你电脑。\n声音克隆、声音设计、视频配音、听写转写、有声书批量旁白全都有，项目称支持 646", "url": "https://x.com/shiyichenDX/status/2119984972375474610"}, {"article": {"title": "今日份 AI 工具圈值得看的资讯"}, "author_id": "2108065841816473600", "created_at": "2026-11-10T04:44:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120014680815214674"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2119…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2119997065820573696", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2119997065820573696", "url": "https://t.co/QqZpRzzQTr"}]}, "id": "2120014680815214674", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/QqZpRzzQTr", "url": "https://x.com/27huff/status/2120014680815214674"}, {"author_id": "1951454477267116032", "created_at": "2026-11-10T02:00:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119973328634941941"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/SWcDySpU7c", "end": 165, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/wangdefapodcast/status/2119973328634941941/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119973325241790464", "start": 142, "url": "https://t.co/SWcDySpU7c"}]}, "id": "2119973328634941941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 9255, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "一九六六年六月，北京大学历史学家翦伯赞在燕东园二十八号的住所，被人贴上了一副对联：“庙小神灵大，池浅王八多。”他是北大副校长、历史系主任，选进高中语文课本的那篇《内蒙访古》，就是他写的。那时他已经被报纸点名批判，又被揪出来批斗过了。那些日子，儿媳带着小孙女来燕东园看望他和妻子戴淑婉 https://t.co/SWcDySpU7c", "url": "https://x.com/wangdefapodcast/status/2119973328634941941"}, {"author_id": "1768521225591304192", "created_at": "2026-11-10T04:33:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120011839815971232"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/QBpgM2Qjlg", "end": 128, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jiangyifengshui/status/2120011839815971232/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120011828566933504", "start": 105, "url": "https://t.co/QBpgM2Qjlg"}]}, "id": "2120011839815971232", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 175, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《黄毛·薄肌·西装：普通人破局的三个段位，多数人卡在第二层》\n\n网上最近很流行两个理论，一个叫“黄毛理论”，一个叫“薄肌理论”\n\n我看了看，很多年轻人在底下奉为圣经\n\n其实你看透了，就会发现这两个理论很真实。 https://t.co/QBpgM2Qjlg", "url": "https://x.com/jiangyifengshui/status/2120011839815971232"}, {"article": {"title": "《长明》第二卷 第二章　缝"}, "author_id": "1474643656229285893", "created_at": "2026-11-10T04:08:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120005702663946368"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2120…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2120004559846113281", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2120004559846113281", "url": "https://t.co/81Z6YJsyok"}]}, "id": "2120005702663946368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 297, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/81Z6YJsyok", "url": "https://x.com/RobbXiao/status/2120005702663946368"}, {"article": {"title": "《顾医生被浇灌的日日夜夜》"}, "author_id": "1324130045149892608", "created_at": "2026-11-10T03:49:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120000829008785445"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2120…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2120000354872